{"id":"en_belated-filial-devotion-is-worthless","title":"Belated Filial Devotion Is Worthless","titleEn":"Belated Filial Devotion Is Worthless","description":"Lucas and Audrey Hayes, both preoccupied with their own lives, send their father Jonathan 20,000 USD every month and bring in Diane Jenkins to look after him. What they fail to see is that Diane and Derek Vance are working together against the old man, mistreating him, keeping food from him, and scheming to take his property. When a fall leaves Jonathan with amnesia, Diane exploits his confusion to pass herself off as someone he trusts, coming close to seizing his entire fortune. Once the siblings learn what has really been happening, they contact the police and promise to look after their father in person from then on. The story makes the point that sending money is no substitute for family presence, and that genuine devotion to one's parents means showing up. Dramzio is a place where thi","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/belated-filial-devotion-is-worthless/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/belated-filial-devotion-is-worthless/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Element","Family Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4ew/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_belated-filial-devotion-is-worthless_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4ew/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_belated-filial-devotion-is-worthless_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dt4ew/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_belated-filial-devotion-is-worthless_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number"